DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppcchhtteemmpp driver provides support for the temperature sensor in the In‐
     tel X99, C610 series, 9 series and 100 series platform controller hub
     (PCH).

     These sensors provide 0.5 degC resolution.  Sensor values are made avail‐
     able through the sysctl(8) interface.

